  "title": "wonderland.jar: legacy edition",
  "description": "Wonderland.jar with the iconic visuals and atmosphere of legacy console Minecraft",
  "body": "# Wonderland.jar: Legacy Edition\n\n### **NOW UPDATED TO MASSIVE WONDERLAND.JAR 3.0 UPDATE!** \n\n**Wonderland.jar brings back the classic console Minecraft feel using the 4JLegacy Mod to recreate the old menus, lighting, and overall atmosphere from the original console editions.**\n\n![In-game screenshot of minecraft player in a dimension with repeating houses in the style of legacy console](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b09e2b31b1d1b3571e2c74622390e1a6b79ff3b4.jpeg)\n\nThe pack includes the Legacy Skin Packs Mod, so you can use classic console skins right away. \n\n![Legacy Console Skin Selector](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2ed31124e6bb6c50390c23f5a5dd47ecba5170a6.jpeg)\n\nThe music is limited to tracks by C418 to keep the original Minecraft sound and mood intact.\n\nThe pack also includes Modern Beta, letting you enable world generation from any version of Minecraft you want.\n\nShaders are fully supported, and a VHS-style shader is already installed if you want that retro screen effect.\n\n",
